# Al Anfal Doc

> Dubai company formation, trade licence renewal, government approvals, document attestation and visa application support for business owners, investors and expatriates.

Al Anfal Doc is based in Dubai, UAE. Phone: +971 50 805 1192. Email: info@alanfaldoc.com. Hours: Mon-Fri: 9:00AM - 6:30PM; Saturday: 8:30AM - 3:30PM; Sunday: Closed.

## Services
- [Company Formation](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/company-formation): Mainland and free zone company setup in Dubai and the UAE with full legal support.
- [PRO Services](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/pro-services): Professional government documentation and liaison services for all UAE departments.
- [Visa Processing](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/visa-processing): Employment, family, tourist and golden visa application services.
- [Document Clearing](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/document-clearing): Fast-track approval and attestation for all types of business and personal documents.
- [Trade License](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/trade-license): New trade licence issuance and annual renewals across all UAE emirates.
- [Legal Translation](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/legal-translation): Certified translation and attestation for legal and business documents.
- [Bank Account Opening](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/bank-account-opening): Corporate and personal bank account opening assistance with major UAE banks.
- [Business Consulting](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/business-consulting): Expert guidance on UAE business regulations, compliance and growth.
- [Business Immigration](https://alanfaldoc.com/services/business-immigration): Golden visa, residence permits and work visas for business owners and investors.

